      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Actually I want to see list of friends per instance, when I join F / F+ instances I'm joining a group of people, not just a specific friend...\n\nIt's always somewhat awkward when you join a friend, but that friend is talking with bunch of people I don't know at all. I want to be intentional about joining such instance, not accidental.\n\nThis is especially severe when you're bi/tri-lingual and friends only speak 1 language.",
      "viewerReactions": null
